          "source_behavior": ["base/fttype1.c returns Invalid_Face_Handle for null face and Invalid_Argument for null output.", "Type 1, CID, and Type 42 services copy face-owned FontInfo records.", "CFF builds/caches PS_FontInfoRec from top dict values; CFF2 returns Invalid_Argument.", "Faces without ps_get_font_info return Invalid_Argument."],
